<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Chairly – Scheduling Built for Barbers</title>
<meta name="description" content="Chairly is the booking app for barbers. Fill your chair, cut no-shows, and get paid without the back-and-forth.">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #14110f;
    --paper: #faf6f0;
    --accent: #c8402a;
    --gold: #d9a441;
    --muted: #6d6560;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --line: #e7dfd3;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  header { padding: 20px 0; }
  header .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
  .logo span { color: var(--accent); }
  nav a { margin-left: 28px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted); }
  nav a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    transition: transform .15s, background .15s;
  }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .btn-ghost { background: transparent; }

  .hero { padding: 80px 0 90px; }
  .hero .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .eyebrow { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  h1 em { font-style: normal; background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, var(--gold) 62%); }
  .hero p.lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .hero .cta { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .fine { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }

  .phone {
    background: var(--ink); border-radius: 36px; padding: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(20,17,15,.25); max-width: 340px; margin: 0 auto;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
  }
  .screen { background: var(--paper); border-radius: 24px; padding: 22px 18px; }
  .screen h4 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .screen small { color: var(--muted); }
  .slot {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 12px 14px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .slot b { display: block; }
  .tag { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #e8f3e6; color: #2f7a2b; }
  .tag.open { background: #fbeed0; color: #946a10; }
  .tag.pending { background: #fde4df; color: var(--accent); }

  .logos { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 22px 0; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }

  section { padding: 90px 0; }
  .section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 56px; }
  .section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .section-head p { color: var(--muted); }

  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px; }
  .card .icon { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .card h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.96rem; }

  .dark { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
  .dark .section-head p { color: #b9b0a6; }
  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
  .step .num { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .step h3 { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .step p { color: #b9b0a6; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 64px; }
  .stats strong { display: block; font-size: 3rem; letter-spacing: -2px; color: var(--accent); }
  .stats span { color: var(--muted); }
  .quote { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 36px; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .quote p { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .quote cite { color: var(--muted); font-style: normal; font-size: 0.92rem; }

  .pricing { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .plan { position: relative; }
  .plan.featured { border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
  .plan .badge { position: absolute; top: -13px; left: 30px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .price { font-size: 2.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin: 10px 0 4px; }
  .price small { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .plan ul { list-style: none; margin: 20px 0 26px; }
  .plan li { padding: 6px 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .plan li::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 800; margin-right: 10px; }
  .plan .btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; }

  details { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 22px; margin: 0 auto 12px; max-width: 760px; }
  summary { font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  details p { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); }

  .final { text-align: center; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-radius: 28px; padding: 70px 24px; }
  .final h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .final p { margin-bottom: 28px; opacity: .92; }
  .final .btn { background: #fff; color: var(--ink); border-color: #fff; }

  footer { padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero .wrap, .grid, .steps, .stats, .pricing { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    nav { display: none; }
    .hero { padding-top: 40px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="#" class="logo">Chair<span>ly</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#start" class="btn btn-ghost" style="padding:10px 20px;font-size:.9rem;">Log in</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:90px;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Scheduling built for barbers</p>
        <h1>Keep your hands on the clippers, not your <em>phone.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Chairly fills your chair, cuts no-shows, and handles every booking, reminder, and payment automatically. Your clients book in 15 seconds. You get your time back.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-primary">Start free for 14 days</a>
          <a href="#how" class="btn btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="fine">No credit card required. Set up in under 10 minutes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="screen">
          <h4>Today, Saturday</h4>
          <small>6 cuts booked · 2 open slots</small>
          <div class="slot"><div><b>10:00 AM · Marcus T.</b><small>Skin fade + beard</small></div><span class="tag">Confirmed</span></div>
          <div class="slot"><div><b>10:45 AM · Devon R.</b><small>Classic taper</small></div><span class="tag">Confirmed</span></div>
          <div class="slot"><div><b>11:30 AM · Open</b><small>Tap to share on Instagram</small></div><span class="tag open">Open</span></div>
          <div class="slot"><div><b>12:15 PM · Luis G.</b><small>Lineup · Deposit due</small></div><span class="tag pending">Pending</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="logos">Trusted by independent barbers and shops in 40+ cities</div>

  <section id="features">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Everything your shop needs. Nothing it doesn't.</h2>
        <p>Built with working barbers, so it fits how a real day behind the chair actually goes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><div class="icon">📅</div><h3>Your own booking link</h3><p>Drop it in your Instagram bio, Google profile, or text thread. Clients pick a service and time with no app download or account.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon">🔔</div><h3>Automatic reminders</h3><p>Text and email reminders go out on their own. Clients confirm, reschedule, or cancel with one tap.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon">💳</div><h3>Deposits and no-show fees</h3><p>Require a deposit for new clients or late cancels. Get paid straight to your bank, usually next day.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon">⚡</div><h3>Waitlist fill</h3><p>When someone cancels, Chairly offers the slot to your waitlist instantly, so the chair rarely sits empty.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon">💈</div><h3>Multi-barber shops</h3><p>Individual calendars, booth rent tracking, and shared branding. Every barber controls their own hours and prices.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon">📝</div><h3>Client notes</h3><p>Remember every client's guard sizes, preferences, and last cut. Look like you never forget a face.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how" class="dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Up and running before your next cut</h2>
        <p>Three steps. No tech skills needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Set your menu</h3><p>Add services, prices, and durations. Set your hours and breaks once.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Share your link</h3><p>Post it to your bio, print the QR code for your mirror, or text it to regulars.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Show up and cut</h3><p>Bookings land on your calendar, reminders run themselves, and payments roll in.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stats">
        <div><strong>-68%</strong><span>fewer no-shows</span></div>
        <div><strong>6 hrs</strong><span>saved on admin each week</span></div>
        <div><strong>+22%</strong><span>more bookings on average</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quote">
        <p>"I used to answer DMs until midnight. Now clients just book themselves, and my Saturday chair is full by Thursday."</p>
        <cite>Andre W., owner of Crown &amp; Blade Barbers</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Simple pricing. No cut of your tips.</h2>
        <p>Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid pricing">
        <div class="card plan">
          <h3>Solo</h3>
          <div class="price">$15<small>/month</small></div>
          <p>For independent barbers</p>
          <ul><li>Online booking link</li><li>Text &amp; email reminders</li><li>Client profiles</li><li>Card payments</li></ul>
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-ghost">Start free trial</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card plan featured">
          <span class="badge">MOST POPULAR</span>
          <h3>Pro</h3>
          <div class="price">$29<small>/month</small></div>
          <p>For busy chairs</p>
          <ul><li>Everything in Solo</li><li>Deposits &amp; no-show fees</li><li>Waitlist auto-fill</li><li>Instagram &amp; Google booking</li></ul>
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-primary">Start free trial</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card plan">
          <h3>Shop</h3>
          <div class="price">$20<small>/barber/month</small></div>
          <p>For teams of 3 or more</p>
          <ul><li>Everything in Pro</li><li>Shared shop page</li><li>Booth rent tracking</li><li>Owner reports</li></ul>
          <a href="#start" class="btn btn-ghost">Start free trial</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="faq" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Questions barbers ask</h2></div>
      <details><summary>Do my clients need to download an app?</summary><p>No. They book through your link in any browser. No account or download required.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I move over my existing clients?</summary><p>Yes. Import a spreadsheet or your phone contacts, and we'll help you set it up for free.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do payments work?</summary><p>Clients can pay by card at booking or in the chair. Funds go to your bank account, typically the next business day.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I need to cancel my plan?</summary><p>Cancel anytime in two clicks. You can export all your client data whenever you want.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="start" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="final">
        <h2>Fill your chair. Keep your evenings.</h2>
        <p>Join thousands of barbers who stopped chasing bookings and started cutting.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Start your free trial</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">© 2026 Chairly, Inc. · <a href="#">Privacy</a> · <a href="#">Terms</a> · <a href="#">Contact</a></div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
```
